# Data Flow - Level 1 DFD Template

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "External Entities"
        User[User]
        ExtAPI[External API]
    end
    
    subgraph "System Processes"
        P1[Process 1: Authentication]
        P2[Process 2: Data Processing]
        P3[Process 3: Notification]
    end
    
    subgraph "Data Stores"
        D1[(User DB)]
        D2[(Cache)]
        D3[(Log Store)]
    end
    
    User -->|Credentials| P1
    P1 -->|Validated User| P2
    ExtAPI -->|Data Feed| P2
    P2 -->|Processed Data| D1
    P2 -->|Cache Update| D2
    P2 -->|Events| P3
    P3 -->|Notifications| User
    P1 -->|Auth Logs| D3
    P2 -->|Audit Trail| D3
```

## Usage
Decompose your context diagram into major processes and data stores.